1
00:00:00,050 --> 00:00:03,294
But wait: where did the light at the dark points go?

2
00:00:03,294 --> 00:00:04,244
Nowhere.

3
00:00:04,244 --> 00:00:05,390
It was moved.

4
00:00:05,390 --> 00:00:08,919
Without interference, every point would get two I nought.

5
00:00:08,919 --> 00:00:12,252
With it, bright points get four I nought and dark points zero.

6
00:00:12,252 --> 00:00:16,484
Average it over one fringe, and you get exactly two I nought.

7
00:00:16,484 --> 00:00:19,023
Interference redistributes energy.

8
00:00:19,023 --> 00:00:20,468
It never destroys it.

